Z||000012||Cheever2||06-13-2001||01:31 AM||||I am AT my job 8 hours every evening (I won't say that I WORK 8 hours  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ).  During about 6 hours of that time I can and do read the PFF, but I cannot post messages from work anymore.  I freqently check the local and national radar loops, and spend a little time at other websites, but mostly this Forum.  I have a job with a great deal of spare time (usually), and I COULD use that time reading to learn new things about my department or my company, but in more than 24 years in my career I have often seen such effort gone to waste, and I refuse to knock myself out for nothing.  And at 44 years old, I'd rather relax a little and enjoy what I do as much as possible without striving for some higher illusive plateau.<P>On a side note, I'd like to see some more of you join the Chat in the evenings.  It's always the same people, which is fine but we need some new opinions, etc.<BR>||||reg||6
